<title>INDIA: India Mata's  MATASEC auction table on 4-yr paper.</title>
<headline>India Mata's  MATASEC auction table on 4-yr paper.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mata Securities said on Monday it expected a cut-off rate of below 10.87 percent at Monday's auction of 4-year stock by the government to raise 50 billion rupees.</p>
<p>Mata has prepared the following ready reckoner for post auction trades. 		     IF THE CUT OFF IS AT</p>
<p>			--------------------</p>
<p>And your bid is at</p>
<p>  (pct)   10.80   10.81   10.82   10.83   10.84   10.85   10.86</p>
<p> 10.80	100  100.03  100.06  100.09  100.12  100.16  100.19</p>
<p> 10.81	 NA     100  100.03  100.06  100.09  100.12  100.16</p>
<p> 10.82	 NA	NA     100  100.03  100.06  100.09  100.12</p>
<p> 10.83	 NA	NA	NA     100  100.03  100.06  100.09</p>
<p> 10.84	 NA	NA	NA	NA     100  100.03  100.06</p>
<p> 10.85	 NA	NA	NA	NA	NA     100  100.03</p>
<p> 10.86	 NA	NA	NA	NA	NA	NA     100</p>
<p>NOTE : NA - No Allotment.</p>
<p>	   -- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
